# Dynamic Context Builder

Instead of a static prompt, create a **Context Builder Service**.

```text
Story

↓

Story Analyzer

↓

Extract Concepts

↓

Find Relevant Documents

↓

Find Relevant Repository Files

↓

Find Similar Stories

↓

Find Architecture Docs

↓

Rank Everything

↓

Assemble Prompt

↓

Bedrock
```

This makes every AI call deterministic and reproducible.

